&lt;li&gt;The Membership Specialist (MS) will represent UFC GYM by providing a welcoming, informative and entertaining experience for all members and guests during their visits. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Membership Specialist is responsible for driving potential members into the gym to deliver industry leading customer services to them as well as our current members. &lt;/li&gt;
