&lt;li&gt;Follow up with members that have enrolled to ensure we are exceeding expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide the highest level of customer service possible when communicating and interacting with guests. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in maintaining a clean and operational facility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
