&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Commission and bonus based on sales and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;: Depending on client needs, we will prioritize your scheduling preferences. We have multiple shifts for you to choose from. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We provide online certifications and training. Select courses provide required CEUs to renew your certification(s).  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Paid Training&lt;/strong&gt;: Learn the fundamentals of sales and growing your business. We offer a paid onboarding program along with ongoing 1:1 coaching. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;UFC GYM&lt;/strong&gt;: Work for a fitness brand that is internationally famous! &lt;/li&gt;
